<title>USA: Viacom's Blockbuster names CFO.</title>
<headline>Viacom's Blockbuster names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blockbuster, a unit of Viacom Inc, said on Monday Lynn Lyall had been named chief financial officer, overseeing the video and music retailer's financial systems and operations.</p>
<p>Lyall will succeed Al Detz, Blockbuster chief financial officer since 1992, who has elected not to relocate to Dallas with the company, the company said.</p>
<p>Lyall most recently worked with Cadbury Schweppes Plc, Blockbuster said.</p>
<p>Detz will remain with Blockbuster for a transition period as the company relocates its headquarters to Dallas and leave the company at a later time, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
